            answer: "B",
            solution: `<p>printf returns the number of characters printed.</p>
<p>Also:</p>
<ul>
<li>&amp; has higher precedence than &amp;&amp; and ||</li>
<li>&amp;&amp; and || use short-circuit evaluation</li>
</ul>
<p>First expression:</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>BC</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p>
<p>Step 1:</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>prints</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>returns</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>true</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p>
<p>Step 2:<br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>BC</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo></math><br />&nbsp;Both execute because &amp; does not short-circuit</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>BC</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
<p>So:<br />&nbsp;1 &amp;&amp; 0 = 0</p>
<p>Printed so far: ABC<br />Then prints 0</p>
<p>Second expression:</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>BC</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>PQR</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>prints</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>returns</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>
<p>Since || short-circuits on true, the right side is NOT evaluated</p>
<p>So only A is printed, result = 1</p>
<p>Third expression:</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>BC</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>UVW</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>BC</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>true</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>
<p>Now:<br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>printf</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>UVW</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>short</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>circuit</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>so</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>"</mo><mi>UVW</mi><mo>"</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NOT</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>printed</mi></math></p>
<p>Result = 1</p>
<p>Final output: &nbsp;ABC0A1ABC1</p>`
