<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; unsigned&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>char</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>*</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>char</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>*</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>arr</mi><mo>;</mo></math></p>
