<li>Search 24: h(24)=4 <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> slot 4 has 34 (not 24) <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> slot 5 has 24 <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> 2 probes</li>
