            text: `<p>A queue is implemented using two stacks,s S1 and S2. Enqueue pushes onto S1. Dequeue pops from S2; if S2 is empty, all elements of S1 are moved to S2 first.</p>
<p>The following operations are performed on an initially empty queue:</p>
<p>Enqueue(1), Enqueue(2), Enqueue(3),</p>
<p>Dequeue(),</p>
<p>Enqueue(4), Enqueue(5),</p>
<p>Dequeue(), Dequeue(),</p>
<p>Enqueue(6),</p>
<p>Dequeue(), Dequeue()</p>
<p>Which of the following statements is/are FALSE after all operations are complete?</p>`,
            image: "",
