            text: `<p>Heap sort is performed on the array:</p>
<p>A = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6, 5, 3] (0-indexed, n=10)</p>
<p>The algorithm first builds a max-heap using the O(n) bottom-up procedure, then repeatedly extracts the maximum.<br />After the build heap phase is complete, the value at index 0 of the array be X.<br />Then after exactly 3 extract-max operation m(each followed by heapify-down) the value at index 0 be Y.<br />What is the sum of X+Y?</p>`,
            image: "",
            options: [
                ``,
                ``,
                ``,
                ``,
            ],
            answer: 14,
            solution: `<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>After</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>build</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>heap</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Root</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>index</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>
<p>3 Extract-Max operations:</p>
<p>Extract #1: Swap root with last:<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>heap</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>size</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>down</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>index</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>value</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>size</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>After</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>#</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p>
<p>Extract #2: Swap root with last of heap: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>heap</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>size</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>down</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>idx</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>value</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>size</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>:</mo></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>After</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>#</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p>
<p>Extract #3: Swap root with last of heap:<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>heap</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>size</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>down</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>idx</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>value</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>size</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>:</mo></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>After</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>#</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p>
<p>Root after 3 extractions = 5. Sum<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>
<p>Correct Answer: 14</p>`
