            text: `<p>A hash table of size m = 7 uses chaining. After inserting n = 21 keys (load factor &alpha; = n/m = 3), assume the simple uniform hashing assumption holds.</p>
<p>Which of the following statements is/are TRUE?</p>`,
            image: "",
