            text: `<p>Consider the array:</p>
<p>A = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6, 5, 3, 8], (indices 1 to 11)</p>
<p>The LIS (Longest Increasing Subsequence) uses strict inequality (each next element must be strictly greater than the previous).</p>
<p>Two quantities are asked:</p>
<ol>
<li>Length of LIS = L</li>
<li>Number of distinct LIS of length L = C</li>
</ol>
<p>What is the value of L+C?</p>`,
            image: "",
            options: [
            ],
            answer: 7,
            solution: `<p><strong>Step 1: Find the LIS length</strong></p>
<p>A subsequence must be:</p>
<ul>
<li>in the same order</li>
<li>strictly increasing</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Possible LIS:</strong></p>
<p>Starting with 1: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>1</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Length: 5</p>
<p>Starting with 3: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>3</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Length:5</p>
<p>No larger element exists after 888. So the maximum possible length is: L=5</p>
<p><strong>Step 2: Count the number of LIS</strong></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>LIS</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>LIS</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>
<p>Hence, C=2</p>
<p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Compute the answer</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>​</mo></math></p>`
