<p>The Matrix Chain Multiplication DP computes <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">j</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>=the minimum number of scalar multiplications to compute the product of matrices <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi></msub></math> through <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>ⱼ</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p>
