            text: `<p>How many 4-digit numbers can be formed using digits&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>}</mo></math> with no digit repeating, such that the number is divisible by 4?</p>`,
            image: "",
