<p>Days&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>4</mn><mo>&ndash;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi></math> work (A left).<br />Rate&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>per</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>day</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />Work in 3 days <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></math>.</p>
