            answer: "A",
            solution: `<p>Check each letter shift in MATRIX&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&rarr;</mo></math> OCVTKZ:<br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">V</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">T</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">I</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">K</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Z</mi></math></p>
<p>Verify with VECTOR &rarr; XGEVQT:<br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">V</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">G</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">V</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">T</mi></math></p>
<p>Pattern: each letter shifted +2 forward.</p>
<p>SCALAR:&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">U</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">N</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">T</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi>UECNCT</mi></math></p>`
