            type: "NAT",
            text: `<p>Four fair coins are tossed simultaneously. Given that at least two coins show heads, what is the probability that exactly three show heads? Express as a fraction p/q in lowest terms and enter&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">q</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>`,
