            options: [
                ``,
                ``,
                ``,
                ``,
            ],
            answer: 15,
            solution: `<p>Total outcomes&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>
<p>P(at least 2 heads)<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">H</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">H</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">H</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>outcomes</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>
<p>P(exactly 3H | at least 2H) = 4/11.</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">q</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>`
