            solution: `<p>Number of data blocks&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Primary index has one entry per data block = 2000 index entries.<br />Index blocks&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></math> index blocks.</p>
<p>Binary search on index:&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&lceil;</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>₂</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&rceil;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&lceil;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&rceil;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math> block accesses.<br />Then 1 data block access.<br />Total =&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>`
