            text: `<p>Consider relation&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>)</mo></math> with FDs:</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>AB</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>CD</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>DE</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi></math></p>
<p>Compute the closure of AB under the given FDs. How many attributes are in (AB)+?</p>`,
