            solution: `<p>Start:&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>{</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>}</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>AB</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>add</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Set</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>{</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>}</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>add</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Set</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>}</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>CD</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>:</mo></math> have C and D. Add E.&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>Set</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>}</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>DE</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;already have B.</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>(</mo><mi>AB</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>}</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Count</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>`
