<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">R</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi></math> produces 10,000 tuples.&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>⋈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">T</mi></math> produces 100 tuples. Cost of each join = number of tuples in its output.</p>
