            answer: "C",
            solution: `<p>All rows of A are multiples of [1,2,3]. rank(A)=1.</p>
<p>Augmented matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>]</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ᵀ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&times;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ᵀ</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>rank</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>rank</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>rank</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&rarr;</mo></math>consistent<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&rarr;</mo></math>infinitely many solutions.</p>
<p><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>Nullity</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&minus;</mo><mi>rank</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&minus;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Solution space dimension = 2.</p>`
