            text: `<p>X and Y are independent standard normal random variables (mean 0, variance 1). What is&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>[</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>XY</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo><mo>?</mo></math></p>`,
