            neg: 0,
            type: "NAT",
            text: `<p>The solution to&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>dy</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> with y(0) = 1 becomes unbounded (blows up) at x =?</p>`,
