            type: "MSQ",
            text: `<p>Grammar:&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi>iSeS</mi><mo>|</mo><mi>iS</mi><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi></math><br />Which of the following are TRUE?</p>`,
