            marks: 1,
            neg: 0.33,
            type: "MCQ",
            text: `<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi></msup><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">b</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">j</mi></msup><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">c</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi></msup><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>}</mo><mo>.</mo></math> Correctly classify L.</p>`,
