            text: `<p>Which of the following correctly describes the relationship between the Post Correspondence Problem (PCP) and context-free grammar ambiguity? Before answering, note that reduction-direction questions are a classic source of reversed-logic traps; confirm carefully which problem is used as the known-hard building block and which is being proven hard as a consequence, rather than assuming symmetry between the two directions.</p>`,
