            solution: `<p>Worst-case settling time <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mo>&times;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi>pd</mi></msub></math> = <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>ns</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>80</mn></math> ns (the carry/toggle must ripple through all 4 stages sequentially).<br />Maximum frequency<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>/</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>ns</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>= <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0125</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>GHz</mi></math> <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>MHz</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>`
