<p>A: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>0</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />B: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>0</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />C: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>0</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">E</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />D: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>0</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />E: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>0</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />F: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>0</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">F</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>
