            type: "NAT",
            text: `<p>Bag A has 3 red and 2 blue balls. Bag B has 1 red and 4 blue balls. A bag is chosen with probability &frac12; each, and two balls are drawn from it without replacement. Given that both drawn balls have the same colour, the probability that the bag was A is ______ (correct to 2 decimal places).</p>`,
