<li><strong>(A):</strong> the sequence ⟨P2, P1, P0, P3, P4⟩ completes: Work goes (2,2,1) <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&rarr;</mo></math> (3,4,2) <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&rarr;</mo></math> (5,4,3) <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&rarr;</mo></math> (6,5,3) <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&rarr;</mo></math> (6,6,5) <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&rarr;</mo></math> all finish. The state is safe.</li>
