            text: `<p>Graph G has vertices 1, &hellip;, 6, the edges of the cycle 1&ndash;2&ndash;3&ndash;4&ndash;5&ndash;6&ndash;1, and the chord {1, 4}. How many proper vertex colourings of G exist using colours from a fixed set of 4 distinguishable colours (not all colours need be used)?</p>`,
