            type: "MSQ",
            text: `<p>Let <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi><mn>60</mn></msub></math> be the set of positive divisors of 60 ordered by divisibility, with meet = gcd and join = lcm. Which of the following is/are TRUE?</p>`,
