            type: "NAT",
            text: `<p>Bellman&ndash;Ford is run from source <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi></math> on the directed graph with edges <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi></math> (4), <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi></math> (-2), <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi></math> (3), <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi></math> (2), <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi></math> (6), <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi></math> (12)[cite: 1]. In every pass, edges are relaxed in this fixed order: <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi></math>, <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi></math>, <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi></math>, <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi></math>, <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">B</mi></math>, <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi mathvariant="normal">S</mi><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">D</mi></math>[cite: 1]. The algorithm stops after the first pass in which no distance changes[cite: 1]. How many passes are executed, counting that last pass?[cite: 1]</p>`,
            image: "",
