<li>The count is<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>&minus;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>&minus;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mo>&minus;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1026</mn><mo>.</mo></math></li>
